{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39986","headline":"病中春日即事寄主人尚书二首 一 · 徐夤","name":"病中春日即事寄主人尚书二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身比秋荷觉渐枯，至君经国堕前图。\n层冰照日犹能暖，病骨逢春却未苏。\n镜里白须撏又长，枝头黄鸟静还呼。\n庾楼恩化通神圣，何计能教掷得卢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}